<title>FINLAND: OKOBANK TO ISSUE SIX-YEAR FIM 100 MLN BOND.</title>
<headline>OKOBANK TO ISSUE SIX-YEAR FIM 100 MLN BOND.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooperative banking group OKOBANK said in a statement on Friday its investment banking arm OKO-Investointipankki Oy would issue a 100 million markka six-year bond with a 5.10 percent coupon.</p>
<p>The subscription rate is variable and the subscription period runs from June 9 to October 9, OKOBANK said.</p>
<p>Coupons will paid annually and a bourse listing will be sought for the bond after the subscription period, it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
